sql
SELECT name, AVG(price) AS avg_price
FROM Assets
GROUP BY name;
This shows you the average price for each asset—helping you spot big changes.

4. Look at Latest Changes
You might also want to see if todays price is far away from its average. For a quick check, you could do something like:

sql
SELECT a.name, a.price, a.recorded_at, t.avg_price,
       a.price - t.avg_price AS deviation
FROM Assets a
JOIN (
