    FROM Assets
    WHERE recorded_at > NOW() - INTERVAL '1 day'
    GROUP BY name
) t ON a.name = t.name
WHERE a.recorded_at > NOW() - INTERVAL '1 day';
This tells you if the newest prices are off the normal trend (the “deviation”).

